# uptools configuration
# The tools run by 'uptools' and 'uptools update' (one per line, # for comments).
# A tool that is not listed here is not run; use 'uptools target <names>' for those.
# Run 'uptools show' to see all known tools.
#
# Nothing is enabled by default: uncomment the tools you want.

